{"source": "app_details", "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=2479810&cc=us&l=english", "collected_at": "2026-10-22T19:30:59Z", "http_status": 200, "payload": {"2479810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gray Zone Warfare", "steam_appid": 2479810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/6438c525be0c79d596fb5b335ff06d0a.avif?t=1792688598\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras_big/6438c525be0c79d596fb5b335ff06d0a.webp?t=1792688598 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Ops introduces an exciting new gameplay loop centered around crafting and building your Hideout, alongside new high-risk tasks and contraband operations that let you build your reputation as a rogue PMC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can now create multiple playable characters and explore plenty of new content, including new weapons and enormous new locations. The update also brings a wide range of community-requested improvements, a streamlined health system, enhanced visuals, and environmental improvements that make Lamang feel more alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get one step closer to Ground Zero, and expect more to come in future updates. Where others end, we begin.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hideout</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smuggling, Hunting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New major locations and numerous small locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living World</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anti-Cheat Measures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamlined health system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 new weapons, 340+ weapon parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio polish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New AI behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reworked Combat Outposts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economy balancing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual polish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clouds refactor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Technical improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OptimizationTechnical improvements</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/55b9af672c0124e2347eed4cfd4b57a2.poster.avif?t=1792688598\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/55b9af672c0124e2347eed4cfd4b57a2.webm?t=1792688598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/55b9af672c0124e2347eed4cfd4b57a2.mp4?t=1792688598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/d0ae33972bc15b60b69dd7c52d2c84b9.poster.avif?t=1792688598\" width=780 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/d0ae33972bc15b60b69dd7c52d2c8